{"skill":{"slug":"stripe-api","displayName":"Stripe"},"version":{"version":"1.2.7","createdAt":1790940114482,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":68293,"sha256":"cf57ff605c8be0fd197f1a9b28cd6d077932a5bc7225e515e893f22e2b0a5f6c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2121,"sha256":"9c7ce63b32271f9e71b8adbf5cb17aa8ea0423577035cdab07b650fc23915096","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790940681737,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"53f8280a315242e37b75abd19a38e1f38e440e591678e2a6bc373f968c214e2a","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/53f8280a315242e37b75abd19a38e1f38e440e591678e2a6bc373f968c214e2a","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790940410384},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":13,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1790940681737},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a clearly disclosed Stripe administration skill with high-impact financial capabilities, but its sensitive behavior is purpose-aligned and guarded by explicit approval instructions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, Maton authentication, and Stripe account access are proportionate to the integration. The raw HTTP fallback uses MATON_API_KEY only for environments without the CLI and includes secret-handling warnings.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses a pinned Maton CLI package or Homebrew tap and OAuth login; the artifact contains Markdown guidance and no executable install script.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions default to read/list calls, require explicit approval for writes, warn that the generic gateway can reach any /stripe/ path, and treat undocumented endpoints as user-requested exceptions; one appendix fallback contains an incorrect JSON-body instruction for Stripe writes.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill documents persistent credential storage, hosted functions, triggers, and destinations, but frames them as user-approved automation, defaults functions to DENY_ALL networking, warns about persistent forwarding, and includes deletion guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill is intentionally write-capable for Stripe customers, subscriptions, invoices, products, prices, payments, coupons, and refunds; that is high-impact financial access but matches the stated purpose and is repeatedly disclosed.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you need Stripe administration. Use the CLI/OAuth path, connect the least-privileged Stripe account, verify test versus live mode before any write, require explicit confirmation for charges, refunds, invoice, subscription, or deletion actions, and avoid the raw HTTP fallback unless the CLI cannot be used.","findings":"[SDI-1] unexpected: Confirmed: the appendix says direct HTTP writes should use JSON, while the Stripe examples correctly use application/x-www-form-urlencoded. This is a documentation safety defect for a financial API, not evidence of hidden or malicious behavior.\n[SDI-4] unexpected: Confirmed: the direct HTTP example prints the full response body, but the surrounding text warns this is only demonstrative and tells users to extract minimal fields and avoid logging raw responses. This should be improved but does not change the overall coherent purpose.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790940681737}}}}}